BANK_INFO:
The bank used to play music from the Cartooners game. It's built from instruments
are taken from AdLib's examples given for everyone's free use for any purposes.

=============
This is a compatible replacement based on instruments taken from Jamie O'Connel's banks are MIT-licensed.
